# Keep shell scripts LF-only: they ship with a shebang and are run directly.
# A CRLF checkout would break them with "bad interpreter" on Linux/macOS.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Normalise the sources. Everything else in the tree is either binary or does not
# need a rule.
*.py     text
*.c      text
*.h      text
*.md     text
*.S      text
Makefile text

*.bin binary
*.elf binary
